<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale ofthe following vessels.</p>
<p>RORO - Bass Trader - (built 1976) 7,486 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $5 million.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION - Jutha Pariyanat - (built 1972) sold to Bangladeshi breakers for $154 per ldt.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions before completion.</p>
